WEBVTT

00:21.521 --> 00:25.025
THREE YEARS AGO

00:25.108 --> 00:25.942
JAPANESE FORCES

00:26.026 --> 00:26.901
JOSEON FORCES

00:27.402 --> 00:28.653
SANGJU

00:37.162 --> 00:39.539
Is this the plant
that can bring the dead...

00:41.708 --> 00:43.084
back to life?

00:44.586 --> 00:46.254
Yes, my lord.

00:48.339 --> 00:49.841
If you put...

00:50.759 --> 00:54.262
the essence of this plant onto a needle
and insert it in the glabella of the dead,

00:54.345 --> 00:58.641
the body will revive as a monster that
eats the flesh and blood of living people.

00:58.725 --> 01:01.102
But if the center of the brain is damaged,

01:02.145 --> 01:04.939
or if the body has already begun to decay,

01:05.899 --> 01:07.650
resurrection will be impossible.

01:37.722 --> 01:39.599
We are surrounded by Japanese troops.

01:39.682 --> 01:42.018
Sangju is the last place standing
in the Gyeongsang Province.

01:42.102 --> 01:44.312
I heard they have reached
the Unpo Wetland.

01:44.729 --> 01:47.065
If they invade the Unpo Wetland,
Sangju will fall as well.

01:47.148 --> 01:48.108
Then are we all...

01:48.358 --> 01:49.359
going to die?

03:19.032 --> 03:21.159
BASED ON THE KINGDOM OF THE GODS BY YLAB

05:41.841 --> 05:43.593
How can this happen in broad daylight...

05:52.518 --> 05:54.437
Hold your weapons and get into position.

06:03.488 --> 06:04.739
It will not catch fire!

06:57.917 --> 06:58.918
Burn them!

07:03.881 --> 07:04.966
Move back!

07:07.051 --> 07:10.012
Ready the boat! Hurry!

07:10.388 --> 07:11.848
Hurry and ready the boat!

07:30.241 --> 07:31.826
Pull! Now push!

07:44.046 --> 07:46.841
Block them! Block their way!

08:25.505 --> 08:27.423
THE CITADEL OF SANGJU

08:27.507 --> 08:29.425
The infected are approaching.

08:29.509 --> 08:30.885
Master!

08:31.302 --> 08:34.222
The monsters have arrived
at Byeongseong Stream!

08:34.680 --> 08:38.059
BYEONGSEONG STREAM

08:47.026 --> 08:49.278
They will get through soon,
Your Royal Highness!

08:49.445 --> 08:50.655
Prepare the cannons!

09:17.557 --> 09:19.475
Bring the arrows! Hurry!

09:19.559 --> 09:20.518
Get the arrows ready!

09:51.674 --> 09:52.758
Do not fall back!

09:53.009 --> 09:54.719
If they get through, we will all die!

09:54.802 --> 09:55.803
Yes, Your Royal Highness.

10:35.176 --> 10:36.510
Your Royal Highness!

10:36.594 --> 10:38.554
We cannot fight them any longer!

10:39.263 --> 10:40.514
We must go, Your Royal Highness.

10:59.533 --> 11:00.534
THE CITADEL OF SANGJU

11:00.618 --> 11:02.244
That is the fallback signal.

11:02.953 --> 11:04.580
Prepare the rope ladders!

11:48.833 --> 11:49.709
Oh, no.

11:49.792 --> 11:51.085
- Oh, no.
- Goodness!

11:56.424 --> 11:57.466
He got bitten!

11:58.008 --> 11:58.843
No...

11:59.885 --> 12:00.970
It is just a small bite.

12:02.179 --> 12:03.264
It will be okay.

12:06.434 --> 12:07.435
Stop.

12:07.768 --> 12:08.978
No!

12:09.061 --> 12:10.479
No, please!

12:12.523 --> 12:13.357
Help!

12:14.775 --> 12:16.026
- Stay back.
- Help!

12:16.110 --> 12:18.028
Go away. Do not come any closer.

12:18.404 --> 12:19.822
Please!

12:20.448 --> 12:21.699
Help!

12:23.909 --> 12:24.910
No...

12:33.461 --> 12:34.670
What do we do now?

12:35.421 --> 12:36.922
We must go to Sangju.

12:37.298 --> 12:38.924
There will be a path there.

12:39.341 --> 12:41.260
What if the monsters are there, too?

12:41.343 --> 12:43.220
Do you want to freeze to death here, then?

12:50.144 --> 12:53.981
BYEONGSEONG STREAM

12:56.650 --> 12:58.652
THE CITADEL OF SANGJU

12:59.320 --> 13:01.071
- Help!
- Please help!

13:01.155 --> 13:02.406
- Come on!
- Help!

13:02.490 --> 13:04.074
- Hurry! Climb up!
- Help us!

13:04.158 --> 13:06.702
- Save me! Get down from there!
- Come up!

13:06.869 --> 13:08.662
- The infected are here!
- Help me!

13:30.810 --> 13:32.645
The infected have passed
Byeongseong Stream.

13:35.105 --> 13:38.150
Your Royal Highness, we must head
to the north branch of the stream.

13:38.234 --> 13:41.111
There is a passageway there
that was made during the war.

13:42.446 --> 13:43.906
Let's go. Escort him!

13:45.324 --> 13:46.534
Hurry!

13:54.083 --> 13:57.127
HONGCHI GATE

14:21.402 --> 14:23.153
- The gate is locked.
- Damn it!

14:25.197 --> 14:26.282
Damn...

14:26.365 --> 14:28.200
- Move aside!
- Form a barrier!

14:28.284 --> 14:31.036
- Form a barrier!
- Make haste!

14:31.120 --> 14:32.997
- Form a barrier!
- Quick!

14:33.747 --> 14:34.582
Hurry!

14:43.632 --> 14:44.550
They are coming.

14:44.633 --> 14:45.718
They are here!

14:45.801 --> 14:47.177
The infected are coming!

14:47.261 --> 14:48.262
Hurry!

14:50.222 --> 14:51.765
Form a barrier!

15:43.901 --> 15:45.402
Make way!

15:51.700 --> 15:53.285
Hurry!

15:57.831 --> 15:58.958
Get out of the way!

16:09.343 --> 16:10.970
Your Royal Highness!

16:11.053 --> 16:12.388
The gate is open!

16:12.513 --> 16:15.140
- Your Royal Highness!
- The gate is open!

16:15.224 --> 16:16.934
- Your Royal Highness!
- Your Royal Highness!

16:17.017 --> 16:17.893
Your Royal Highness!

16:17.977 --> 16:19.436
Your Royal Highness, hurry!

16:19.520 --> 16:20.437
This way!

16:27.945 --> 16:29.363
Go inside! Now!

16:30.823 --> 16:31.991
What are you doing?

16:33.575 --> 16:34.451
You cannot do this.

17:12.740 --> 17:16.660
Escort Lord Ahn! Hurry!

17:34.511 --> 17:35.345
We must go.

18:16.261 --> 18:17.471
I am sorry.

19:04.393 --> 19:05.435
Your Royal Highness.

19:08.647 --> 19:09.857
What happened?

19:12.109 --> 19:14.403
You told us they return
to being corpses in the morning.

19:16.196 --> 19:17.364
I do not know what happened.

19:18.991 --> 19:20.951
They used to disappear
when the sun came up.

19:22.703 --> 19:24.246
I am sure of it.

19:39.136 --> 19:40.262
The reason...

19:43.432 --> 19:44.975
is not important.

20:30.646 --> 20:32.564
Seo-bi, help me. Please.

20:33.273 --> 20:34.816
Seo-bi!

21:05.639 --> 21:07.683
Why are they still moving around?

21:08.475 --> 21:10.477
Did they not disappear
when the sun came up?

21:11.853 --> 21:15.190
The resurrection plant likes the cold.

21:16.233 --> 21:18.193
If they have the same tendency,

21:18.402 --> 21:20.070
they are not afraid of sunlight.

21:20.904 --> 21:23.407
They only hate high temperatures.

21:24.199 --> 21:27.452
But since it is winter now,
it is still cold even when the sun is up.

21:27.536 --> 21:29.496
That is why they have not fallen asleep.

21:44.136 --> 21:47.306
Their number has not increased
since yesterday.

21:50.976 --> 21:52.019
What do you mean?

21:52.769 --> 21:55.480
They are the only monsters nearby.

21:55.689 --> 21:58.317
That is why their number
has not increased at all so far.

21:59.901 --> 22:01.945
Let us say there are
no other monsters around here.

22:02.654 --> 22:04.656
But there will be hundreds of them
near the citadel.

22:04.906 --> 22:06.825
How do we get all the way there?

22:07.117 --> 22:09.369
No, we should head up there
instead of to the citadel.

22:09.453 --> 22:11.872
We may be able to
stay away from them up there

22:11.955 --> 22:13.999
since they cannot cross the water.

22:16.501 --> 22:19.338
Seo-bi. Up the mountain?

22:19.421 --> 22:21.006
Where are you thinking of going?

22:22.632 --> 22:24.801
Did you not tell me before

22:24.885 --> 22:27.471
that you will be safe because
you belong to the Haewon Cho Clan?

22:27.554 --> 22:29.222
Let us go to Mungyeong Saejae.

22:32.017 --> 22:33.810
Wait, Seo-bi...

22:36.605 --> 22:39.816
SUNGRYE GATE

22:49.117 --> 22:50.410
Make sure you do not miss a spot.

22:51.995 --> 22:53.121
Spread some over there too.

22:53.705 --> 22:55.624
There will be a plague soon
in Hanyang as well.

22:57.584 --> 22:58.627
Hurry up.

22:58.710 --> 23:00.837
I hear that ghosts are coming
from the south.

23:06.551 --> 23:10.305
The Chief State Councillor has gone
to Mungyeong Saejae due to urgent matters.

23:10.680 --> 23:13.642
What is so important that I had to leave
the State Council and come here?

23:13.892 --> 23:14.851
What do I need to see?

23:15.519 --> 23:16.978
It is a very important matter.

23:17.270 --> 23:19.398
You must see this for yourself, my lord.

23:32.119 --> 23:33.245
What is this?

23:36.164 --> 23:38.917
We found these women
outside the north gate last night.

23:39.626 --> 23:41.670
According to the autopsy,

23:41.753 --> 23:43.255
one of the women had just given birth.

23:44.339 --> 23:46.716
The baby found with this woman

23:47.217 --> 23:49.928
was strangled to death
before we found them.

23:50.679 --> 23:52.139
Did you find the culprit?

23:52.639 --> 23:55.851
They said this woman said something
before her death.

23:56.184 --> 23:59.312
She said that the people living
in her village hurt her and her child,

23:59.855 --> 24:02.941
and that they would kill everyone else
as well. Those were her last words.

24:03.733 --> 24:04.818
Where is that village?

24:15.787 --> 24:17.873
Naeseonjae of Samgye-dong,
outside the north gate.

24:18.415 --> 24:20.041
"Naeseonjae"?

24:20.709 --> 24:22.586
Yes, it is where the private residence...

24:23.420 --> 24:25.297
of the Queen's family is located.

25:15.889 --> 25:19.351
The Royal Commandery Division
has found out about Naeseonjae.

25:20.769 --> 25:24.105
We must seek help
from the Chief State Councillor.

25:24.189 --> 25:25.857
No, we cannot tell my father.

25:27.984 --> 25:29.361
We must keep this a secret...

25:32.155 --> 25:33.740
from my father.

25:49.923 --> 25:52.008
I just need to give birth to a prince.

25:54.386 --> 25:57.514
Then whether it be the
Royal Commandery Division or anyone else,

26:00.141 --> 26:02.227
no one will be able to challenge me.

26:19.536 --> 26:21.371
Before the crescent moon sets,

26:22.205 --> 26:24.583
set a ritual table
for the Goddess of Childbirth.

26:25.917 --> 26:26.960
That day,

26:29.504 --> 26:32.424
you will have a prince in your arms.

26:43.351 --> 26:46.896
THE WALLS OF MUNGYEONG SAEJAE

27:07.459 --> 27:09.836
He had a jade ornament
of the Haewon Cho Clan,

27:09.919 --> 27:11.880
so we let him enter the gates.

27:13.298 --> 27:14.174
Uncle!

27:19.387 --> 27:21.348
It is your only nephew, Beom-pal.

27:22.015 --> 27:24.851
On the first day as a magistrate
in Dongnae, a strange disease broke out.

27:25.018 --> 27:27.145
I barely made it out alive
and came all the way here.

27:27.479 --> 27:29.189
Please take me in.

27:30.065 --> 27:30.982
Right.

27:32.025 --> 27:34.819
I was the one
who made you the magistrate of Dongnae.

27:35.445 --> 27:39.991
But the only thing you did
in that position of high responsibility...

27:40.950 --> 27:42.911
was save your own life?

27:46.122 --> 27:48.917
Uncle, I do not understand what you mean.

27:49.000 --> 27:51.795
Your job was to take care of Dongnae.

27:53.505 --> 27:56.758
What were you doing
while the Commander of the Royal Army...

27:58.051 --> 28:01.805
was killed by the Crown Prince in Dongnae?

28:04.516 --> 28:07.185
Are you saying Beom-il is dead?

28:08.353 --> 28:10.188
I did not know.

28:10.647 --> 28:12.315
I really had no idea!

28:14.484 --> 28:15.568
Please believe me!

28:17.737 --> 28:19.197
You should be grateful...

28:21.366 --> 28:23.993
that the Haewon Cho Clan's blood
runs in you.

28:26.705 --> 28:28.456
He is the magistrate of Dongnae...

28:29.457 --> 28:31.459
and the only heir to the Haewon Cho Clan.

28:32.836 --> 28:34.838
Treat him accordingly.

28:38.466 --> 28:39.801
What about that woman?

28:46.057 --> 28:50.270
The thing is, she is a physician who
worked for the physician Lee Seung-hui.

28:50.353 --> 28:53.398
She helped me get all the way here alive.

28:55.525 --> 28:57.694
"The physician Lee Seung-hui"?

29:00.655 --> 29:01.906
Is that true?

29:05.785 --> 29:07.120
Yes, my lord.

29:08.705 --> 29:11.374
Prepare some lodgings for her too.

29:21.009 --> 29:23.678
THE CITADEL OF SANGJU

30:13.603 --> 30:15.271
Even if we save the food and eat little,

30:15.897 --> 30:17.607
the food will only last us five days.

30:18.733 --> 30:21.236
There are so many refugees.

30:23.404 --> 30:26.908
Hand out food to everyone here
each morning.

30:28.701 --> 30:30.411
It is right to save food,

30:30.912 --> 30:32.956
but the people should not starve.

30:45.176 --> 30:47.387
This is not the disease we know.

30:48.513 --> 30:50.640
It was not like this three years ago.

30:51.182 --> 30:52.892
The infected only ate human flesh.

30:53.434 --> 30:55.270
Getting bitten did not lead to infection,

30:55.353 --> 30:57.772
and the infected did not go wild like this
after sunrise.

31:00.733 --> 31:01.860
Lord Cho Hak-ju...

31:02.902 --> 31:04.821
was hiding something about this disease.

31:05.154 --> 31:06.322
He deceived you...

31:07.198 --> 31:08.783
and all of us, my lord.

31:14.956 --> 31:16.958
What exactly are you trying to say?

31:19.919 --> 31:21.045
I believe...

31:22.088 --> 31:24.048
we are paying for what we did then.

31:24.507 --> 31:26.301
We are being punished.

31:30.972 --> 31:32.181
Do you regret it?

31:35.018 --> 31:36.227
My lord.

31:39.397 --> 31:41.065
I do not regret it.

31:41.608 --> 31:44.485
Three years ago, we saved Sangju.

31:44.944 --> 31:46.487
We saved Gyeongsang.

31:47.614 --> 31:49.198
If I were given the choice again,

31:49.657 --> 31:51.367
I would do the same.

31:54.871 --> 31:56.122
My apologies.

31:56.998 --> 31:59.042
I must have lost my mind for a moment.

31:59.626 --> 32:02.253
I will go and check the security
around the citadel with the others.

32:41.000 --> 32:41.834
Your Royal Highness.

33:08.486 --> 33:09.487
Your Royal Highness.

33:11.072 --> 33:13.074
I overheard Lord Ahn Hyeon
and one of his men...

33:14.200 --> 33:16.035
saying something strange.

33:17.036 --> 33:18.871
They seemed to know many things...

33:19.580 --> 33:21.374
about the disease.

33:22.792 --> 33:25.712
And it seems like Lord Cho Hak-ju
is involved as well.

33:27.880 --> 33:28.840
Your Royal Highness.

33:29.424 --> 33:31.759
It would be best to leave this place
as soon as possible.

33:32.385 --> 33:33.970
I will escort you, Your Royal Highness.

33:34.637 --> 33:36.681
It will be safe once we go back
through the passageway

33:37.140 --> 33:39.267
and cross the north branch.

33:45.440 --> 33:47.900
Why are you telling me this?

33:50.069 --> 33:50.987
Pardon?

33:58.536 --> 34:00.163
Did Cho Hak-ju order you to?

34:01.998 --> 34:03.166
Your Royal Highness.

34:04.500 --> 34:06.335
Lord Ahn Hyeon told me...

34:07.170 --> 34:09.881
that the palace guards knew
I was coming here.

34:12.717 --> 34:14.177
Was it your doing?

34:20.933 --> 34:21.934
Are you...

34:23.811 --> 34:25.897
trying to drive a wedge...

34:26.773 --> 34:28.566
between him and me now?

34:29.901 --> 34:31.110
Your Royal Highness.

34:35.406 --> 34:37.366
Do you not trust me?

34:40.536 --> 34:42.789
I left my pregnant wife,

34:44.248 --> 34:46.542
my family, and everything I had...

34:47.960 --> 34:50.463
and followed you
all the way here to Gyeongsang.

34:53.841 --> 34:56.427
Do you still not trust me,
Your Royal Highness?

35:04.435 --> 35:05.561
Fire!

35:07.188 --> 35:08.731
There is a fire!

35:09.732 --> 35:11.317
Fire!

35:12.568 --> 35:13.736
Fire!

36:11.502 --> 36:12.587
What about the food?

36:13.212 --> 36:15.339
Did you take out all the food
that was inside?

36:15.923 --> 36:16.883
We could not, sir.

36:20.803 --> 36:22.847
What were you doing all this time?

36:23.639 --> 36:25.224
What were you doing while that happened?

36:25.308 --> 36:26.726
We do not know, sir.

36:26.809 --> 36:28.477
There was a sudden explosion, and...

36:28.561 --> 36:29.645
You fool!

36:31.314 --> 36:33.900
Do you not know how valuable
that warehouse was?

36:34.233 --> 36:37.111
The lives of everyone in the citadel
depended on the food that was inside!

36:37.195 --> 36:38.237
I am sorry.

36:38.779 --> 36:39.739
It is all my fault.

36:41.199 --> 36:42.116
Such insolence!

36:42.200 --> 36:43.075
It was me!

36:46.537 --> 36:47.914
It was me.

36:55.004 --> 36:56.255
It was not their fault.

36:58.716 --> 36:59.592
It was me.

37:02.094 --> 37:03.346
I did it.

37:05.681 --> 37:07.934
I could not let my child starve to death,

37:08.893 --> 37:11.062
so I was just trying to take some rice.

37:12.188 --> 37:13.814
I did not know this would happen.

37:14.857 --> 37:16.192
I accidentally...

37:16.692 --> 37:18.444
I accidentally dropped my lamp.

37:22.949 --> 37:24.033
I am so sorry.

37:27.328 --> 37:28.162
Just...

37:29.747 --> 37:31.415
Just kill me.

37:41.175 --> 37:42.343
We are all...

37:43.761 --> 37:45.096
going to die anyway.

37:47.974 --> 37:49.183
Whether we starve to death...

37:52.311 --> 37:54.397
or get bitten by those monsters,

37:56.482 --> 37:58.109
we are all going to die.

38:15.209 --> 38:19.714
MUNGYEONG SAEJAE

38:42.486 --> 38:45.614
Do you think that will provide some way
to stop the disease?

38:46.198 --> 38:49.994
However severe the disease,
there was always a way to stop it.

38:50.161 --> 38:52.121
This disease will not be any different.

38:52.997 --> 38:54.707
If I study this plant some more,

38:55.291 --> 38:58.002
I am sure I can find a way
to stop this disease.

38:58.711 --> 39:02.798
We will be safe as long as
we stay in Mungyeong Saejae.

39:06.552 --> 39:09.680
I believe there are people still alive
in the citadel of Sangju.

39:11.891 --> 39:14.101
We have to save those people.

39:15.436 --> 39:17.772
Right, His Royal Highness...

39:18.898 --> 39:20.816
What are you holding in your hand?

39:25.196 --> 39:26.989
Hand it over, now!

39:44.215 --> 39:45.925
Do you know what this plant is?

39:53.557 --> 39:55.142
It is called the resurrection plant,

39:55.643 --> 39:57.228
known to bring back the dead.

39:59.230 --> 40:00.272
That plant...

40:01.732 --> 40:03.359
is what caused this disease.

40:05.152 --> 40:06.946
How do you know this?

40:09.573 --> 40:12.827
I only found out through this physician.

40:15.663 --> 40:18.207
Tell him how you learned about this.

40:24.296 --> 40:27.925
"The resurrection plant
brought the dead king back to life.

40:29.218 --> 40:31.720
And that caused the disease."

40:33.681 --> 40:35.808
Is that what Lee Seung-hui told you?

40:36.517 --> 40:38.144
What do you mean?

40:39.270 --> 40:40.771
"The dead king"?

40:42.898 --> 40:43.941
Please have mercy.

40:44.650 --> 40:47.153
I only found that plant
after reading about it

40:47.236 --> 40:48.946
in his patient journal.

40:49.655 --> 40:51.740
You read about it in his patient journal?

40:53.826 --> 40:55.536
Then do you know...

40:57.455 --> 40:59.457
how to resurrect the dead as well?

41:07.590 --> 41:10.134
"If you mash the resurrection plant,
put it on a needle,

41:10.217 --> 41:13.137
and insert it one pun deep
into the glabella,

41:13.804 --> 41:16.765
the dead will come back to life
in two hours."

41:16.849 --> 41:18.809
That was what was written in his journal.

41:26.317 --> 41:28.486
I will take that girl to Hanyang as well.

41:31.572 --> 41:32.948
Make the preparations.

41:33.532 --> 41:34.450
Yes, my lord.

41:34.909 --> 41:37.119
Are you going to Hanyang? When?

41:42.750 --> 41:44.877
There is still something I must do.

41:45.544 --> 41:47.213
Something I must finish.

41:48.339 --> 41:50.633
I will go back to Hanyang
after I finish it...

41:51.592 --> 41:54.094
and meet the new future prince.

42:00.559 --> 42:03.687
SANGJU, LORD AHN HYEON'S RESIDENCE

42:04.605 --> 42:05.439
What...

42:06.232 --> 42:07.858
What did you just say,
Your Royal Highness?

42:10.319 --> 42:11.987
I will go to Mungyeong Saejae.

42:12.696 --> 42:13.531
Your Royal Highness.

42:14.240 --> 42:17.993
How do you plan to go there
with all those monsters outside?

42:18.661 --> 42:20.412
I must go there
if I want to save everyone.

42:21.580 --> 42:23.374
Please pick out the best of your men.

42:39.265 --> 42:41.141
I will lead the way, Your Royal Highness.

42:52.236 --> 42:53.070
Let's go.

45:41.739 --> 45:43.157
Put out your fires now.

46:06.847 --> 46:08.849
The north branch is very close
to the passageway.

46:08.932 --> 46:11.643
The monsters fear water,
so if we cross the river,

46:12.394 --> 46:14.313
we can get away from them.

46:15.397 --> 46:16.940
Even if you cross the north branch,

46:17.024 --> 46:19.359
it will not be easy to enter
Mungyeong Saejae.

46:20.235 --> 46:21.862
The Five Armies will be
guarding the gates.

46:22.404 --> 46:26.283
The number of soldiers has dropped to
a tenth due to the war three years ago.

46:26.909 --> 46:29.703
There are about 5,000 elite soldiers
in Hanyang alone.

46:30.245 --> 46:31.872
Even with Cho Hak-ju's power,

46:32.498 --> 46:34.792
it would have been difficult...

46:36.043 --> 46:37.586
to send all those men.

46:38.253 --> 46:39.671
At most, the number...

46:40.214 --> 46:42.132
will not go over 2,500,
which is half of that.

46:42.216 --> 46:45.594
That would be a small number
to be guarding...

46:46.804 --> 46:48.347
all the gates in Gyeongsang.

46:48.889 --> 46:50.015
That is right.

46:51.016 --> 46:52.851
If they are spread out
and guarding every gate,

46:53.060 --> 46:55.020
the number of men guarding
Mungyeong Saejae...

46:55.729 --> 46:57.189
will not be more than 500.

46:57.272 --> 46:58.565
They would not be able to guard

46:58.649 --> 47:01.693
every part of Mungyeong Saejae's walls
with that number.

47:01.777 --> 47:05.447
The northwest side of the first gate
has high walls,

47:05.531 --> 47:07.991
so it functions as a defense by itself.

47:08.075 --> 47:10.369
There is a high chance
that fewer men would be guarding it.

47:10.452 --> 47:12.246
WEST SIDE, SOUTH SIDE

47:12.412 --> 47:17.334
So, what do you plan on doing
once you get to Mungyeong Saejae?

47:23.757 --> 47:25.092
I will...

47:27.427 --> 47:28.804
kill Cho Hak-ju.

47:29.638 --> 47:32.015
He disregarded the poverty and starvation
of the people,

47:32.099 --> 47:34.268
and tried to take something
that he should not have.

47:34.977 --> 47:37.187
I will punish him
and return to my rightful place.

47:38.397 --> 47:42.025
I will save the people from
this disastrous starvation and disease.

47:43.068 --> 47:44.736
And I will survive...

47:48.866 --> 47:51.034
and create a new world.

51:31.880 --> 51:33.882
Subtitle translation by Liya Choi
